---
description: Form a consent-aware, non-leading follow-up question about an unresolved recollection.
args: { dossier: OralHistoryDossier; change: ArchiveChange; comparisons: RecollectionComparison[] }
returns: OralHistoryQuestion[]
---
Ask for context that may clarify the speaker's own remembered date, sequence or referent. Do not suggest a preferred answer or pressure a participant to reconcile with another account. Do not contact a speaker whose current consent does not permit follow-up. Preserve nonresponse as unresolved.
